Package: leios.theme.grub-theme
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: grub-common
Description: LeiOS GRUB2 gfxmenu theme
 This package provides the LeiOS theme for the GRUB2 boot menu.
 .
 It includes the theme description, background image, fonts, icons and
 selection artwork for GRUB's gfxmenu subsystem.
 .
 The theme is enabled as a default only: /etc/default/grub.d/leios-theme.cfg
 sets GRUB_THEME and GRUB_GFXMODE unless they are set in /etc/default/grub,
 and the background is provided through the desktop-grub alternative used
 by /etc/grub.d/05_debian_theme.
